# Based on the Ventrax AV4 report and aligned with the current checkout.
Feature: Landing Page purchase and account activation start

  Scenario: Submit installation purchase request successfully
    Given the User is on the Landing Page
    And the User verifies their email with a six-digit code
    And the User enters valid contact and installation details and accepts both legal documents
    And the system creates a provisional installation request and a payment order
    When Billing verifies that the payment was approved
    Then the Landing shows a payment confirmation modal with the registered email
    And the Landing returns to the home page after 10 seconds
    And the system sends a single purchase email with payment confirmation, an activation link, instructions and the electronic receipt PDF

  Scenario: Keep payment disabled until the checkout form is valid
    Given the User is on the Landing Page
    When the email is unverified, a required field is invalid, or either legal document has not been accepted
    Then Continue to payment remains disabled

  Scenario: Prevent access when payment is not confirmed
    Given the User submitted a purchase request
    And the payment was not confirmed
    When the User attempts to activate or access the account
    Then the system denies access
    And the account remains unavailable until payment confirmation
